  "meta": {
    "name": "Sticky tar",
    "description": "Black goo that seeps into the deepest dips. Tanks bog down in it and drive at a third of the speed and range; rollers and bouncing shells stick where they touch it and diggers bore through at half speed. One spark and the whole pool burns for turns.",
